                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The map design is laboriously easter eggy with its intended path for the player to find. The blasters and guns shoot projectiles that are too slow to hit anything properly, yet the lightsaber swinging is alright. I think all of the weapons felt better in Dark Forces II and its massive Half-Like maps were more interesting than these small corridors with a hidden switch on the edge of a cliff. Everything this game does is refined by the sequel.",
